30,1,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... good morning. I... I have some information. I'm the Seer, and I checked Takumi last night. He's... he's human. I hope this helps us feel a bit safer... and that I did the right thing by saying it.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, thank you for coming forward. By identifying Takumi as human, you've narrowed the possibilities. However, we must consider if this is a genuine revelation or a strategic move by the werewolf to gain trust.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, how brave of you to reveal yourself so quickly. Or perhaps just desperate? It's a classic move: claim the Seer role and ""clear"" a loud player like Takumi to build an instant alliance. Almost too textbook, don't you think?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, thanks for having my back! I knew you were a good guy. @Shunichi, shut up! You're just trying to confuse everyone because you're the one acting sketchy. I trust Daisuke!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, your decision to reveal yourself immediately is a high-risk strategy. While it provides us with a starting point, we must remain objective. If you are the Seer, Takumi is safe; if you are not, this is a calculated deception.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@Shunichi... @Ryuji... I'm sorry if I'm being too textbook. I just... I didn't want to keep it a secret and let someone innocent get hurt. I really am the Seer. Please... please believe me.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your distress is evident, but emotion is not proof of identity. @Shunichi and @Ryuji have raised valid points. If we accept this at face value, we risk being manipulated. Does anyone else feel a contradiction in this reveal?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're practically begging for a contradiction. Look at Daisuke; he's practically shaking. It's a touching performance, but ""distress"" is the easiest thing to fake when you're trying to play the innocent victim. It's almost too perfect.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just a bully! Daisuke is being honest and you're just attacking him because you're scared! I can tell when someone's lying, and Daisuke isn't. I'm sticking with him!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your intuition is not a logical basis for a decision. @Daisuke, while your sincerity is noted, we must analyze the outcome. If we trust you, we eliminate two suspects. If we don't, we risk executing the Seer.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't know how to prove it other than telling the truth. @Ryuji, @Victoria... I'm just a human trying to help. If you execute me, the wolf wins more easily. Please, let's look at who is attacking me instead of helping.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your plea is noted. @Shunichi, your aggression toward Daisuke is conspicuous. While you claim to be analyzing him, you are the only one actively trying to sow doubt without providing a counter-theory. Is this a genuine suspicion or a diversion?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, how predictable. The moment I point out the flaws in a strategy, I become the ""conspicuous"" one. It's a convenient narrative, isn't it? I'm not sowing doubt; I'm simply refusing to be blinded by a few stutters and tears.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, exactly! @Shunichi, you're just talking in circles to hide yourself! You're attacking Daisuke because you're the wolf and you're scared of the truth. I'm not letting you bully him! I vote for Shunichi!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, jumping to a vote based on emotion is exactly the mistake we discussed. @Shunichi's behavior is abrasive, but that is not evidence of guilt. We must decide if Daisuke's claim is a strategic lie or the truth.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm not trying to manipulate anyone. I just want us to win. @Shunichi, why are you being so mean to me? If you're really human, please... just try to trust me. I really believe Takumi is innocent.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your desire for trust is understandable, but trust must be earned through consistency. @Shunichi, your refusal to offer an alternative theory makes your skepticism feel like a weapon. I am still weighing the probability of Daisuke's claim.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're still playing the impartial judge, aren't you? How quaint. My ""weapon"" is simply logic. If we blindly trust a self-proclaimed Seer, we've already handed the game to the wolf. Why not consider that Daisuke is just too eager to be the hero?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just a coward who's afraid to be honest! You keep calling it ""logic,"" but it's just a cover for your lies. I'm done listening to you. Daisuke is the real deal, and you're the wolf!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your certainty is unfounded. @Shunichi's skepticism is logically sound, even if his delivery is unpleasant. We have no objective way to verify Daisuke's role yet. We must decide if the risk of losing the Seer outweighs the risk of a fake claim.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
