64,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The results are clear. Shunichi was executed, and Daisuke was attacked. The fact that the werewolf targeted Daisuke immediately after his claim strongly suggests that Daisuke is indeed the Seer. The wolf wanted to silence the source of truth.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Takumi,,I told you guys! I knew Daisuke was honest! The wolf was so scared of him that they killed him right away. Now we just have to find that coward and get them out!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Victoria, your conclusion is the most logical one. The werewolf's attack on Daisuke confirms his role as the Seer and, by extension, validates that Takumi is human. We are now left with Victoria and myself.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, that is the current state of the board. Since Takumi is confirmed human and Daisuke was the Seer, the werewolf must be one of us. I have been observing your logic, but now we must be truly honest.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji, you've been acting all ""logical"" this whole time, but that's exactly what a wolf would do to hide! You didn't trust Daisuke when he was alive, and now he's gone. I bet you're the one who did it!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, my skepticism was not a sign of guilt, but a commitment to the analytical approach we agreed upon. If I were the werewolf, I would have likely supported Daisuke's claim to blend in. Logic dictates we examine the facts.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, your point about blending in is a common strategy, but it is not a proof of innocence. We are now in a position where only one of us is the werewolf. If you are human, then I am the enemy.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji, you're still trying to hide behind your ""logic""! It's just a shield for you to act superior while you kill our friends. I don't trust you! You're the wolf, and I'm going to make sure you're gone!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your accusations are based on a personal dislike of my demeanor, not on evidence. If I were the wolf, I would have no reason to vote for Shunichi and risk narrowing the suspect pool to myself and Victoria.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, your argument regarding the vote for Shunichi is interesting, but a Possessed player would also vote for an innocent to gain trust. However, the numbers are now absolute. Takumi, please stay calm; we must decide based on the remaining possibilities.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, I'm calm! I'm just sick of Ryuji's excuses! He's just trying to trick us with big words while he's the one who killed Daisuke. I'm voting for Ryuji! He's the wolf!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your emotional volatility is making it impossible to have a rational discussion. @Victoria, you know that logic is the only tool we have left. If I were the wolf, I would have manipulated the vote differently. I am human.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
